WEBVTT

00:12:25.752 --> 00:12:30.481
So we blocked her testosterone
with a blocking hormone,

00:12:30.505 --> 00:12:33.964
but we added estrogen,
not at 16, but at 13.

00:12:34.909 --> 00:12:37.489
And so here she is at 16, on the left.

00:12:38.093 --> 00:12:40.371
And on her 16th birthday,
she went to Thailand,

00:12:40.395 --> 00:12:42.673
where they would do
a genital plastic surgery.

00:12:42.697 --> 00:12:44.573
They will do it at 18 now.

00:12:44.597 --> 00:12:46.637
And she ended up 5'11".

00:12:47.312 --> 00:12:50.535
But more than that,
she has normal breast size,

00:12:50.559 --> 00:12:52.847
because by blocking testosterone,

00:12:52.871 --> 00:12:56.225
every one of our patients
has normal breast size

00:12:56.249 --> 00:12:59.259
if they get to us at the appropriate age,

00:12:59.283 --> 00:13:00.434
not too late.